==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu Mikumo & Cat]], [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|Yuma Kuga & Cat]] and [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|Chika Amatori & Cat]]

