*1 [[Black Marmod]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage becomes much easier using lv.30 World Trigger units. If you lack them, bring Sniper Cat, [[Sister Act (Combo)|Sister Act]], and [[Tiny Ancient Hunt (Combo)|Tiny Ancient Hunt]]. Using these two attack UP Cat Combos, it is just possible to clear it by first sending out [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|Chika]] and [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu]]. Then, wait for Osamu to reach the background pole, and then send out [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|Yuma]]. The right timing will mean that Yuma will not be on the frontlines, and the rest of the stage is just to spam out your units.

